      "observed": "R43 (10 kΩ) pulls NET0025, connected to the FLOAT_HIGH input, up to +3V3. R47 (10 kΩ) pulls NET0021, connected to FLOAT_LOW, down to GND.",
      "expected": "The specification assigns the 10 kΩ pull-up to FLOAT_LOW and the pull-down to FLOAT_HIGH; those bias connections should be reversed.",
